19	+The map is generated from an ASCII sketch of one quarter, `assets/source/maps/sliceSeaSketch.ts`: edit it, run `node assets/source/maps/sketch.ts`, then `npm run map:build` (details in `assets/source/maps/README.md`). The `.tmj` stays within the Tiled subset documented in `packages/content/src/tiledMap.ts`, so [Tiled](https://www.mapeditor.org/) opens it.
20	 
